      "id": "home",
      "category": "home",
      "name": "Home",
      "description": "Whether EldenNet is working on this game, and what to do if it is not.",
      "help": {
        "purpose": "See at a glance whether EldenNet is working, and what to do when something is wrong.",
        "steps": [
          "Read the Status card: its first line says how EldenNet stands, the next one why.",
          "Look at Problems: each says what went wrong and what to do about it.",
          "Open System for the details: the start, EldenNet's parts and its log."
        ]
      },
      "related": [
        "system.status",
        "system.logs"
