      "category": "ai",
      "name": "Self-test",
      "description": "Is the model fast and well-formed enough for conversation?",
      "help": {
        "purpose": "Check that your provider answers, how quickly, and that its answers come in the form EldenNet needs.",
        "steps": [
          "Press Run self-test. It takes a few seconds, and works at the title screen too.",
          "Read the verdict: quick, acceptable or slow, for the first words of a reply.",
          "Look down the steps: each says what it checked, and what went wrong if it failed."
        ]
